From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: albardoo02 <akshs@outlook.jp>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 02:43:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(api): add world tick hook and handoff API

Expose WorldTickScheduler so plugins can run code on the thread that ticks
a given world: per-tick PRE/POST hooks and a non-blocking handoff that runs
a task at the start of the target world's next tick.

Hooks and pending handoffs are released when their world is unloaded or the
server stops (swept on the main thread after each tick), and when their
plugin is disabled.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
